{"type":"Film","id":"FR2023_022","slug":"fr2023-022-interdit-aux-chiens-et-aux-italiens","title":{"native":"Interdit aux chiens et aux Italiens","english":"No Dogs or Italians Allowed"},"release":{"type":"Theatrical release","date":"2023-01-25","year":2023},"filmType":"Animation","directors":[{"id":"Alain Ughetto","slug":"alain-ughetto","name":"Alain Ughetto","birthYear":1950,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"France","awards":[]}],"genre":["Historical film (Heritage Film)","Comedy","Drama"],"media":{"posterUrl":"https://medias.unifrance.org/medias/248/212/251128/format_page/interdit-aux-chiens-et-aux-italiens.jpg","trailerUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=185HUoBzYfc"},"synopsis":{"native":"Début du XXe siècle, dans le nord de l’Italie, à Ughettera, berceau de la famille Ughetto. La vie dans cette région étant devenue très difficile, les Ughetto rêvent de tout recommencer à l’étranger. Selon la légende, Luigi Ughetto traverse alors les Alpes et entame une nouvelle vie en France, changeant à jamais le destin de sa famille tant aimée. Son petit-fils retrace ici leur histoire.","english":"Early 20th century, Northern Italy. The Ughetto family, living through difficult times, dreams of a better future abroad. The story tells of Luigi Ughetto crossing the Alps to start a new life in France, thus changing the destiny of his beloved family forever. His grandson travels back in time revisiting their history, in an intimate dialogue with his grandmother Cesira."},"production":[{"country":"France","share":"Majority coproducer"},{"country":"Italy","share":"Minority coproducer"},{"country":"Switzerland","share":"Minority coproducer"},{"country":"Portugal","share":"Minority coproducer"}],"characters":[],"roles":[{"person":{"id":"Alain Ughetto","slug":"alain-ughetto","name":"Alain Ughetto","birthYear":1950,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"France","awards":[]},"role":"Director of the film"},{"person":{"id":"Alain Ughetto","slug":"